   {\n          \"type\": \"basic\",\n          \"from\": {\n            \"key_code\": \"escape\",\n            \"modifiers\": {\n              \"optional\": [\"any\"]\n            }\n          },\n          \"to\": [\n            {\n              \"key_code\": \"escape\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"key_code\": \"japanese_eisuu\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"basic\",\n          \"from\": {\n            \"key_code\": \"open_bracket\",\n            \"modifiers\": {\n              \"mandatory\": [\"left_control\"]\n            }\n          },\n          \"to\": [\n            {\n              \"key_code\": \"escape\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"key_code\": \"japanese_eisuu\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}```","ts":"1632971702.255100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"yosasou","count":1,"users":["U01J7703PFT"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kWz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4d855e31-ae8d-4dcd-94ac-a39a02ae1e9b","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"自分はKarabinerでこれですね","ts":"1632971699.254700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"viLT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2eeb50b6-e4f3-4ee7-aa3a-48bf5c408f96","type":"message","user":"U02GD5GRJ72","text":"こんな感じでできます","ts":"1632971673.254400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FqC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ae1cd0fb-1467-4df0-b977-e25c2793049a","type":"message","user":"U02GD5GRJ72","text":"```function! custom#change_ime(keycode)\n    let OSTYPE = system('uname')\n    if OSTYPE == \"Darwin\\n\"\n        if a:keycode == 'kana'\n            :silent !osascript -e 'tell application \"System Events\"' -e 'key code 104' -e 'end tell'\n        elseif a:keycode == 'eisu'\n            :silent !osascript -e 'tell application \"System Events\"' -e 'key code 102' -e 'end tell'\n        endif\n    endif\nendfunction```","ts":"1632971666.254200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U01J7703PFT"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A4K1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"54359a50-9040-4c2a-b842-db83db4b8e37","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"となると、Win or Linux だとsuperキーをIME切り替えにしていたと？","ts":"1632971647.253800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mpZu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08bb9256-071d-423b-b2ff-03918ece833a","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"そういえばそれも自分はKarabinerでやっている気がします","ts":"1632971603.253000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OFv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ff781f07-d9fc-470f-97bb-bd1fc790c582","type":"message","user":"U02GD5GRJ72","text":"osascript を使えば、vimでescキーを押したときに自動で英数キーを送るようにできて幸せですよ","ts":"1632971582.252500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":2,"users":["U01J7703PFT","U0230SSJ32B"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aRW=Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e8bbd459-8163-46ff-9352-6de1a4194f8f","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"10年以上前からWindowsでも設定していた","ts":"1632971535.252200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8fx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a55e4fb5-9504-4706-b852-a0c9eeb0e006","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"設定できるのであれば全OSこれでいい派","ts":"1632971522.251900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i076"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7fac1b1b-daaa-417f-bc3e-6a3ad432e6b7","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"それぞれ左右のcmd単発でon/offかー\nいまだにIME切り替えキーバインドの『答え』に辿り着いてない\n全OSで使えることを想定すると特に","ts":"1632971499.251500","team":"T03C4RC8V","rep